Responsible and Ethical AI Use
Principles Applied
Transparency: Every AI output is labeled as AI-generated draft requiring human review.
Privacy: No meeting transcripts or emails are stored; processing is ephemeral.
Bias Mitigation: Prompts explicitly ask for neutral, professional tone.
Human-in-the-Loop: Email generation and task planning require user confirmation.
Data Minimization: Only uses text provided by user, no external scraping without consent.
Guardrails Implemented in Code
AI DRAFT - Please review footer on emails
Warning if sensitive data detected (e.g., credit card patterns)
No autonomous sending of emails
Summaries avoid hallucinating attendees/decisions not in transcript
Tools Used
ChatGPT / Gemini for generation
Notion AI concept replicated for task structuring
Prompt engineering to enforce responsible outputs
